WEBVTT

00:04:57.621 --> 00:05:01.288
And the tribe is reintroducing Coho
to a bunch of other rivers.

00:05:02.288 --> 00:05:03.621
Same thing with buffalo.

00:05:03.621 --> 00:05:06.454
Back in the 1800s,
when the railroads were going in

00:05:06.496 --> 00:05:09.996
and native people were literally
being kicked off the land at gunpoint,

00:05:10.038 --> 00:05:11.871
buffalo were nearly exterminated

00:05:11.913 --> 00:05:15.079
because they thought that would
make it easier to subdue the tribes

00:05:15.121 --> 00:05:16.538
who depended on them.

00:05:16.538 --> 00:05:17.704
So get this.

00:05:17.746 --> 00:05:20.621
Most of the buffalo
that you see today in zoos

00:05:20.663 --> 00:05:22.288
or wildlife reserves

00:05:22.329 --> 00:05:24.746
are actually descended
from conservation herds

00:05:24.788 --> 00:05:27.121
that native people protected back then.

00:05:27.663 --> 00:05:30.788
And now the Blackfeet Nation
is bringing free-ranging buffalo